  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 806.04 Asbestos",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 806.04 Asbestos. For asbestos violations, the statement shall read as follows:\n\n“Some people who drink water containing asbestos in excess of the MCL over many years may have an increased risk of developing benign intestinal polyps.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
